Place your TLS certificate and key here:

- tls_cert.pem — TLS certificate (full chain)
- tls_key.pem  — TLS private key

For development, generate self-signed certs:
  openssl req -x509 -newkey rsa:4096 -keyout tls_key.pem -out tls_cert.pem \
    -days 365 -nodes -subj "/CN=mail.yourdomain.com"

# local development:
#   openssl req -x509 -newkey rsa:4096 -keyout tls_key.pem -out tls_cert.pem \
#     -days 365 -nodes -subj "/CN=localhost"
